{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40708","headline":"怀张乔张霞 · 李洞","name":"怀张乔张霞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西风吹雨叶还飘，忆我同袍隔海涛。\n江塔眺山青入佛，边城履雪白连鵰。\n身离世界归天竺，影挂虚空度石桥。\n应念无成独流转，嬾磨铜片鬓毛焦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李洞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40708.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40708","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}